Common Telephone
    documentation "The 10-digit telephone number, including the area code, of an individual or organization."
    shared string TelephoneNumber
        documentation "The telephone number including the area code, and extension, if applicable."
        is part of identity
    descriptor TelephoneNumberType
        documentation "The type of communication number listed for an individual or organization."
        is part of identity
    shared integer OrderOfPriority
        documentation "The order of priority assigned to telephone numbers to define which number to attempt first, second, etc."
        is optional
    bool TextMessageCapabilityIndicator
        documentation "An indication that the telephone number is technically capable of sending and receiving Short Message Service (SMS) text messages."
        is optional
    bool DoNotPublishIndicator
        documentation "An indication that the telephone number should not be published."
        is optional